    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really? i thought the bullet train was always the fastest way to get around japan. are there any other pros/cons i should look at besides just time? maybe regarding cost or if things get delayed a lot? also is the train more reliable for business stuff if i have meetings to get to?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
